    "retrieval_seconds": 0.3860779750102665,
    "answer_seconds": 4.632856316995458,
    "total_seconds": 5.018946683005197,
    "answer": "- **Response:** Engage the incident response team within **15 minutes**.\n- **Containment:** Contain the incident within **1 hour**.\n- **Regulatory notification:** Notify the GDPR supervisory authority within **72 hours**. Notify affected individuals **without undue delay** if the risk is high. State breach-notification deadlines vary by jurisdiction (**14\u201390 days**).\n- **Reporting:** Email **security@acme.com** or call the 24/7 Security Hotline at **1-800-555-CERT**.\n\nThe policy provides no API-specific containment requirements.  \n**Source: \u201cINCIDENT RESPONSE POLICY\u201d**",
